<div dir=3D"auto">Hey Paiute,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">So thank you for your email. I'm going to attach some pho=
tos of myself - a way of saying hello, showing off my piercings, and making=
 sure you never forget me. &#55357;&#56899;</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I know you rangers freak out over public records. But I t=
hink authenticity is important, and I'm giving my energy to your agency. Th=
at's not something I compartmentalize. You get all of me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I wouldn't want to come to Beverly Beach earlier if it me=
ant I couldn't be there October to December. So I was hoping you had other =
projects in your MU - this is still unclear to me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I would ask a favor. I reached out to the VSLs at South B=
each and Nehalem. If you'd be willing to put in a word for me, maybe they w=
ould consider me more seriously. I understand you don't know me yet, but yo=
u will, that's an inevitability, and
 even the most casual comment would help put me on their radar.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'm ready to head north.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Logan, the VSL here, updated OPRIS already, but thank you=
.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Sam &#55357;&#56846;</div>
