<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">Hello,&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">I just thought I would se=
nd a follow-up to this email. I'm still actively working out my schedule fo=
r the year. I've now added Humbug Mountain for May and June! And I'd very m=
uch love to spend the winter at Beverly
 Beach. Hoping to hear from you.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
