<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">Hello,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">My name is Sam, and I=92m=
 writing to express my interest in the volunteer welcome center position at=
 Beverly Beach from October to December.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">I arrived on the Oregon C=
oast in October, starting in Brookings, and have been making my way north a=
long Highway 101. Along the way, I=92ve fallen in love with the area, espec=
ially the state parks. This month, I began
 volunteering at Tugman State Park, and I=92ll be continuing my journey at =
Honeyman State Park in February and March, working in the welcome center.</=
p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">As a freelance programmer=
, I bring a strong work ethic, adaptability, and problem-solving skills to =
my roles. My boss here, Franki, has said she will be a reference for me if =
you'd like to speak to her.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xxxxmsonormal" style=3D"margin:0in">Thank you for considering=
 my application. I would be honored to contribute to Beverly Beach and supp=
ort its mission.</p>
</div>
